            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rational+function"} rational
            2-
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cohomotopy"} Cohomotopy
            of an asymptotic 2-sphere enclosing the monopoles:
          %p#IllustrationAtiyahHitchinQuantization
