          %h3#ReferencesDBraneChargeQuantizationInOrdinaryCohomology D-brane charge quantization in ordinary cohomology
          %p
            Discussion of charge quantization of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-branes"} D-branes
            in (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/relative+cohomology"}> relative
            )
