                    %em Ramond-Ramond Fields, Fractional Branes and Orbifold Differential K-Theory
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0710.2773"} arXiv:0710.2773
            %p
              Discussion of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/real+K-theory"} real K-theory
              for D-branes on
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orientifolds"} orientifolds
              includes the following:
            %p
